"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2a1deca274cc855ac01321f3a583b858/offering-help-tip-popover%402x.png","line":27,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an annotation-style tip on iPhone. The tip is embedded among the surrounding content, and points to a feature depicted by a blue star icon. Displaced text appears above and below the tip.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e2b5c6a0a9d94a6c7a16cb1b2c9be517/offering-help-tip-annotation%402x.png","line":31,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an hint-style tip on iPhone. The tip is embedded among the surrounding content. Displaced text appears above and below the tip.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/706238176beb6869a8cf4cd06e22912c/offering-help-tip-hint%402x.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a hint-style tip with an unfilled blue star symbol on the leading side.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e4a119cd09255a5e22c5132263c39cd9/offering-help-tip-symbol-usage-unfilled-incorrect%402x.png","line":47,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a hint-style tip with a filled blue star symbol on the leading side.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/be5eb0f23474419bcb3b182b24c24d77/offering-help-tip-symbol-usage-filled-correct%402x.png","line":51,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":53,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an annotation-style tip pointing to a feature depicted by a blue star icon. The tip includes a similar blue star symbol on its leading side.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b35499b146567d76a7ca996cf3efb9e9/offering-help-tip-symbol-usage-incorrect%402x.png","line":57,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":59,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an annotation-style tip pointing to a feature depicted by a blue star icon. The tip is text-only and omits an accompanying symbol.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/afa3b233a9ec05e15e54fd1ec909c015/offering-help-tip-symbol-usage-correct%402x.png","line":61,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":63,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/offering-help#Platform-considerations","line":67},{"title":"macOS, visionOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/offering-help#macOS-visionOS","line":71},{"title":"`help(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/help\\(_:\\","line":73},{"title":"An illustration of a toolbar in macOS Finder with the pointer over the Back button. A tooltip with the title See folders you viewed previously appears beneath the pointer.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a5dc5c63ac62773df2b4aea95ad85f39/offering-help-macos-tooltip-help-tag%402x.png","line":75,"embedded":true},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/offering-help#Resources","line":89},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/offering-help#Related","line":91},{"title":"Onboarding","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/onboarding","line":93},{"title":"F